# 439 re-eval: prediction dumps and EM diagnostics are large and regenerable.
# Keep the CODE, the READMEs and the scored result tables; drop the bulk artifacts.
#   - preds_*.json      re-run the relevant Modal app
#   - em_diag_*.json    mirrored on Modal vol tcd04-phase4-vol:/out/em_diag/
#   - *_reranked.json   rebuilt in seconds by confidence/rerank_val.py
